                    <span class="absolute -top-10 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 bg-black/80 text-white text-xs py-1 px-2 rounded opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity whitespace-nowrap">Görüntülü ara</span>
